  **Executor:** GitHub Actions
  **Diagram:**
  ```flowchart
  flowchart TB
    P["GitHub Actions"] -->|Schedule the restock alert for Mondays| T1["GitHub Actions workflow"]
    P -->|Read items at or below their reorder point| T2["Northwind Order Service"]
    P -->|Send the alert email| T3["Store mail service"]
