agent: **Here is a proposed starting point for your request:**
  # Weekly Reorder Point Alerts
  ## Problem
  Popular items sell out before anyone notices. Orders then wait for stock, which breaks one-day shipping.
  ## Actors
  The warehouse lead, who checks stock and receives the alert. Customers, whose orders wait for stock.
  ## Current Process
  The warehouse lead checks stock against reorder points by hand every Monday in a spreadsheet.
  ## Desired Change
  Items at or below their reorder point are found automatically each week, with one alert sent to the warehouse lead.
  ## Success Measure
  No order waits on an item that was below its reorder point on the previous alert.
  ## Business Constraints
  No business constraints.
  ## Solution Constraints
  - **Allowed Solution Classes:** Scheduled automation
  - **Existing Platforms Required:** None
  - **Existing Platforms Preferred:** GitHub Actions
  - **Known Systems:** The spreadsheet used for the Monday reorder-point check
  - **Hosting Restrictions:** None
  - **Vendor Restrictions:** No new paid vendors
  - **Procurement Constraints:** None
  - **Regulatory Restrictions:** None
